---
layout: layouts/kitchen.vto
base: ../
title: Guide | Diffuse
---

<style>
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .getting-started {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 200;

    li {
      display: inline-flex;
    }

    li a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .with-icon {
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
  }

  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    font-weight: 100;
    gap: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    text-align: center;

    & > div > span {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: var(--container-md);
    }
  }
</style>

<h1 hidden>Guide</h1>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="flex" style="color: var(--accent-twist-2)">
    <span>Infinite interfaces to interact with your data.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flex" style="color: var(--accent-twist-4)">
    <span>Countless features to extend your experience.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="getting-started">
  <div class="columns">
    <ul class="flex" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md); max-width: 100%; padding-left: 0">
      <li class="with-icon">
        <a class="with-icon" href="{{ ('facets/connect/index.html') |> facetLoaderURL }}">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-number-circle-one" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <i class="ph-fill ph-file-audio" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <span>Add some audio</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="with-icon">
        <a class="with-icon" href="{{ ('facets/data/process-tracks/index.html') |> facetLoaderURL }}">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-number-circle-two" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <i class="ph-fill ph-gear-fine" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <span>Wait until processed</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="with-icon">
        <a class="with-icon" href="featured/">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-number-circle-three" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <i class="ph-fill ph-paint-brush" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <span>Explore interfaces</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <ul class="flex" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md); max-width: 100%; padding-left: 0">
      <li>
        <a class="with-icon" href="featured/">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-number-circle-four" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <i class="ph-fill ph-sparkle" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <span>Enable additional features</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li>
        <a class="with-icon" href="{{ ('facets/connect/index.html') |> facetLoaderURL }}">
          <i class="ph-fill ph-number-circle-five" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <i class="ph-fill ph-person" style="opacity: 0.4"></i>
          <span>Sync or share data</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

